Comment: 0,0:19:13.19,0:19:23.11,INJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(0,350)\blur1}大切な日常が　ここにあるの
Comment: 0,0:19:30.17,0:19:37.32,INJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(250,0)\blur1}ねえ　寄り添うことで　伝えようとした
Comment: 0,0:19:37.32,0:19:43.03,INJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur1}不器用なとこ　好きだよ
Comment: 0,0:19:43.03,0:19:49.99,INJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(0,350)\blur1}私今きっと幸せだよ
Comment: 0,0:19:50.56,0:19:57.52,INJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(250,0)\blur1}誰も知りえない　運命のかごの中で
Comment: 0,0:19:57.52,0:20:00.21,INJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur1}Behind you
Comment: 0,0:20:00.21,0:20:04.61,INJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur1}笑って少し泣いて
Comment: 0,0:20:04.61,0:20:08.35,INJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur1}私のいる意味が
Comment: 0,0:20:08.35,0:20:15.14,INJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(0,350)\blur1}君の手で生まれかえられていく
Comment: 0,0:20:17.01,0:20:20.77,INJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(250,350)\blur1}ほら、ほら　ね？
Comment: 1,0:20:33.31,0:20:35.79,INJP,bg,0,600,0,karaoke,{\fad(250,350)\blur1\c&H63B7E7&}Tell me
Comment: 0,0:20:34.40,0:20:38.08,INJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(250,0)\blur1}気持ちはさわれない
Comment: 1,0:20:36.92,0:20:38.08,INJP,bg,0,600,0,karaoke,{\fad(250,0)\blur1\c&H63B7E7&}Tell me
Comment: 1,0:20:38.08,0:20:39.30,INJP,bg,0,540,0,karaoke,{\fad(0,350)\blur1\c&H63B7E7&}Tell me
Comment: 0,0:20:38.08,0:20:41.50,INJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur1}言葉では言えない
Comment: 1,0:20:40.39,0:20:41.50,INJP,bg,0,540,0,karaoke,{\fad(250,0)\blur1\c&H63B7E7&}Tell me
Comment: 1,0:20:41.50,0:20:42.68,INJP,bg,0,710,0,karaoke,{\fad(0,350)\blur1\c&H63B7E7&}Tell me
Comment: 0,0:20:41.50,0:20:46.63,INJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur1}嬉しいことだけじゃない
Comment: 0,0:20:46.63,0:20:50.14,INJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur1}わかりあってすれちがって
Comment: 0,0:20:50.14,0:20:53.80,INJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur1}ほほえんで泣きあって
Comment: 0,0:20:53.80,0:20:57.01,INJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur1}間違ってぶつかりあう
Comment: 0,0:20:57.01,0:21:03.70,INJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(0,350)\blur1}それが「そばにいること」
Comment: 0,0:21:04.87,0:21:11.94,EDJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(250,350)\blur1}ねえずっと　どうして隠れてるの？
Comment: 0,0:21:12.41,0:21:19.26,EDJP,,0,810,0,karaoke,{\fad(250,0)\blur1}二人じゃなければ　届かない場所があるよ
Comment: 0,0:21:19.26,0:21:21.94,EDJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur1}Behind you
Comment: 0,0:21:21.94,0:21:25.92,EDJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(0,350)\blur1}顔を見せてみて
Comment: 0,0:21:26.35,0:21:29.58,EDJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(250,350)\blur1}飽き飽きするほどに
Comment: 0,0:21:30.09,0:21:36.66,EDJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(250,350)\blur1}側で囁き続けてあげるよ
Comment: 0,0:21:54.13,0:22:01.46,EDJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(250,0)\blur1}二人で一つだと信じ合えるのがイイ
Comment: 0,0:22:01.46,0:22:05.70,EDJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur1}言葉、仕草、今日も明日も
Comment: 0,0:22:05.70,0:22:08.93,EDJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(0,350)\blur1}止められない
Comment: 0,0:22:10.58,0:22:17.62,EDJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(250,350)\blur1}私今きっと幸せだよ
Comment: 0,0:22:18.17,0:22:25.05,EDJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(250,0)\blur1}誰も知りえない　運命のかごの中で
Comment: 0,0:22:25.05,0:22:27.69,EDJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur1}Behind you
Comment: 0,0:22:27.69,0:22:32.13,EDJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur1}分かり合えるなら
Comment: 0,0:22:32.13,0:22:39.23,EDJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur1}溢れだす気持ちを　半分こにしよう
Comment: 0,0:22:39.23,0:22:42.84,EDJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur1}You and me
Comment: 0,0:22:42.84,0:22:46.40,EDJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur1\c&H5AB5F4&}You and me
Comment: 0,0:22:46.40,0:22:50.18,EDJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur1\c&HD081FF&}You and me
Comment: 0,0:22:50.18,0:22:53.49,EDJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur1}声がする
Comment: 0,0:22:53.49,0:23:04.40,EDJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur1}You and me　ここにいてよ
Comment: 0,0:23:04.40,0:23:11.22,EDJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(0,350)\blur1}君の手で生まれかえられていく
Comment: 0,0:23:13.01,0:23:16.45,EDJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(250,350)\blur1}ほら、ほら　ね
Comment: 0,0:23:21.07,0:23:24.61,EDJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(250,0)\blur1}大好き
Comment: 0,0:23:24.61,0:23:28.18,EDJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur1\c&H5AB5F4&}大好き
Comment: 0,0:23:28.18,0:23:32.32,EDJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(0,550)\blur1\c&HD081FF&}大好き
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,//------------------EDCN-------------------
Comment: 2,0:19:02.10,0:19:10.51,INCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(250,0)\blur1}能從你呼吸的律動感覺得到哦
Comment: 2,0:19:10.51,0:19:13.19,INCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur1}真是溫暖啊
Comment: 2,0:19:13.19,0:19:23.11,INCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(0,350)\blur1}珍惜的日常生活就在這裡
Comment: 2,0:19:30.17,0:19:37.32,INCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(250,0)\blur1}你知道嗎  你試圖藉由依偎傳達心意
Comment: 2,0:19:37.32,0:19:43.03,INCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur1}你笨拙的那點  我很喜歡哦
Comment: 2,0:19:43.03,0:19:49.99,INCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(0,350)\blur1}我現在一定很幸福
Comment: 2,0:19:50.56,0:19:57.52,INCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(250,0)\blur1}在誰也無法知曉的命運牢籠中
Comment: 2,0:19:57.52,0:20:00.21,INCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur1}Behind you
Comment: 2,0:20:00.21,0:20:04.61,INCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur1}笑著並稍微落淚
Comment: 2,0:20:04.61,0:20:08.35,INCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur1}我的存在意義
Comment: 2,0:20:08.35,0:20:15.14,INCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(0,350)\blur1}將由你的雙手重新塑造
Comment: 2,0:20:17.01,0:20:20.77,INCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(250,350)\blur1}你看  你看  對吧？
Comment: 3,0:20:33.31,0:20:35.79,INCN,bg,0,390,0,karaoke,{\fad(250,350)\blur1\c&H63B7E7&}Tell me
Comment: 2,0:20:34.40,0:20:38.08,INCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(250,0)\blur1}心情不會受影響
Comment: 3,0:20:36.92,0:20:39.30,INCN,bg,0,390,0,karaoke,{\fad(250,350)\blur1\c&H63B7E7&}Tell me
Comment: 2,0:20:38.08,0:20:41.50,INCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur1}有些事無法言說
Comment: 3,0:20:40.39,0:20:42.68,INCN,bg,0,390,0,karaoke,{\fad(250,350)\blur1\c&H63B7E7&}Tell me
Comment: 2,0:20:41.50,0:20:46.63,INCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur1}不僅僅是開心事
Comment: 2,0:20:46.63,0:20:50.14,INCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur1}相互理解又各自偏執
Comment: 2,0:20:50.14,0:20:53.80,INCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur1}一同歡鬧又相擁流淚
Comment: 2,0:20:53.80,0:20:57.01,INCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur1}偶爾還會因誤會而爭執
Comment: 2,0:20:57.01,0:21:03.70,INCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(0,350)\blur1}這就是「陪伴在你身邊」
Comment: 0,0:21:04.87,0:21:11.94,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(250,350)\blur1}你為什麼一直躲著呢？
Comment: 0,0:21:12.41,0:21:19.26,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(250,0)\blur1}有些地方只有你我一起才能抵達哦
Comment: 0,0:21:19.26,0:21:21.94,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur1}Behind you
Comment: 0,0:21:21.94,0:21:25.92,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(0,350)\blur1}讓我看看你的臉吧
Comment: 0,0:21:26.35,0:21:29.58,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(250,350)\blur1}直到你厭煩為止
Comment: 0,0:21:30.09,0:21:36.66,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(250,350)\blur1}我都會一直在你身邊低語
Comment: 0,0:21:54.13,0:22:01.46,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(250,0)\blur1}能夠彼此相信你我是一體的真好
Comment: 0,0:22:01.46,0:22:05.70,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur1}無論是言行舉止  或是今天明天
Comment: 0,0:22:05.70,0:22:08.93,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(0,350)\blur1}都無法阻止
Comment: 0,0:22:10.58,0:22:17.62,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(250,350)\blur1}我現在一定很幸福
Comment: 0,0:22:18.17,0:22:25.05,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(250,0)\blur1}在誰也無法知曉的命運牢籠中
Comment: 0,0:22:25.05,0:22:27.69,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur1}Behind you
Comment: 0,0:22:27.69,0:22:32.13,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur1}如果我們能彼此理解
Comment: 0,0:22:32.13,0:22:39.23,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur1}那就將滿溢的情感平分吧
Comment: 0,0:22:39.23,0:22:42.84,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur1}You and me
Comment: 0,0:22:42.84,0:22:46.40,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur1\c&H5AB5F4&}You and me
Comment: 0,0:22:46.40,0:22:50.18,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur1\c&HD081FF&}You and me
Comment: 0,0:22:50.18,0:22:53.49,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur1}傳來了一道聲音
Comment: 0,0:22:53.49,0:23:04.40,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur1}You and me  留在這裡吧
Comment: 0,0:23:04.40,0:23:11.22,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(0,350)\blur1}將由你的雙手重新塑造
Comment: 0,0:23:13.01,0:23:16.45,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(250,350)\blur1}你看  你看  對吧
Comment: 0,0:23:21.07,0:23:24.61,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(250,0)\blur1}最喜歡你了
Comment: 0,0:23:24.61,0:23:28.18,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur1\c&H5AB5F4&}最喜歡你了
Comment: 0,0:23:28.18,0:23:32.32,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(0,550)\blur1\c&HD081FF&}最喜歡你了
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,//------------------SCREEN-------------------
